NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000960 "=head1 SUPPORT"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000961 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000962 "The Template Toolkit mailing list provides a forum for discussing"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000963 "issues relating to the use and abuse of the Template Toolkit.  There"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000964 "are a number of knowledgeable and helpful individuals who frequent the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000965 "list (including the author) who can often offer help or suggestions."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000966 "Please respect their time and patience by checking the documentation"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000967 "and/or mailing list archives before asking questions that may already"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000968 "have been answered."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000969 ""
